; =====================================================================
; CAP-NEUTRAL RESEARCH — NOT PRODUCTION CONFIGURATION
; =====================================================================
; DRAFT 2026-10-02. Approved option: B-EXPOSURE-CAP option B (tester only).
; Plan: research/capneutral/CAPNEUTRAL_RESEARCH_PLAN.md
;
; Use: Strategy Tester only, via research/capneutral/run_capneutral_batch.sh,
; which turns the active lines below into the [TesterInputs] block of each run.
; NEVER load this file on a live or demo chart. The production default of
; InpMaxSameCurrencyNet stays 2 in NEXA_Risk.mqh (approved hash 7fd5692a…),
; which this file does not and cannot change.
;
; Exactly ONE value differs from production: InpMaxSameCurrencyNet.
;   production: 2      -> cap = 2 x 0.01 lot   = 0.02 lots per currency
;   this file : 10000  -> cap = 10000 x 0.01   = 100 lots per currency
; 100 lots can never bind before the unchanged margin limit (InpMaxMarginUsagePct
; = 50 % of free margin): at $50,000 and 1:200, 50 % of margin supports at most
; about 50 lots of USDJPY (the cheapest of the four to margin), about 43 of
; EURUSD, 37 of GBPUSD and 11 of XAUUSD. The cap is
; therefore inert; every other hard limit below stays at its frozen value and is
; written out explicitly so a cached tester setting cannot silently change it.
; =====================================================================

; ---- the single research override --------------------------------------
InpMaxSameCurrencyNet=10000

; ---- frozen hard-risk limits, pinned at their production values ---------
InpRiskPercent=0.30
InpHardRiskCeiling=1.00
InpMaxDailyLossPct=2.00
InpMaxDrawdownPct=10.00
InpMaxTradesPerDay=10
InpMaxSpreadATRRatio=0.15
InpMaxMarginUsagePct=50.0
InpMaxCorrelation=0.75
InpCorrelationBars=100
